@andrewhmir/dsh-plan-review README · @andrewhmir/dsh-plan-review — read the whole plan before you approve it：With this plugin installed, that question takes over the composer and renders
the **complete plan inline**, with `Accept plan` / `Revise plan` at the top and
**highlight → comment** on any passage. You decide with the plan on screen.

@andrewhmir/dsh-plan-review README · Install：The package is a DSH **bundle**: it declares `dsh.bundle.patch` and one
client+host plugin row (`id: plan-review`). Install it into the profile you run,
then restart `dsh web`.

@andrewhmir/dsh-plan-review README · From a plugin market：Enable DSH's custom plugin market, add a community index that lists this package
(the repository carries the **`dsh-plugin`** GitHub topic so indexes can discover
it), and install `@andrewhmir/dsh-plan-review` from the Discover tab.

@andrewhmir/dsh-plan-review README · With the agent：```
plugin_manager install_bundle  target: @andrewhmir/dsh-plan-review@0.1.0
```

@andrewhmir/dsh-plan-review README · From a local checkout：```
plugin_manager install_bundle  target: /absolute/path/to/dsh-plan-review
```

@andrewhmir/dsh-plan-review README · The protocol (agent-facing)：```json
{
  "id": "plan-review",
  "header": "[plan-review]",
  "question": "path: C:\\ws\\.superpowers\\plans\\feature.md\nReview the plan below.",

@andrewhmir/dsh-plan-review README · The protocol (agent-facing)：The plugin refuses to send an accept answer while comments or an overall note
exist: a label decision has no field for them, so it asks for
`Request changes` (or for the comments to be deleted) instead.
